Subject: [PATCH 16/16] J714s developer image: lid angle and ambient light
 sensors (linux-aurora j714s3-8)

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-8 adds the AOP's als and las services
to the device tree and builds aop_als/aop_las (DjDeveloperr's #1542/#1548).
From betizzel/omarchy-m5 (68aafa3d).
